000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. GRPREDEF.
000300* A group REDEFINES stays open across all of its subordinates, so
000400* the item after it belongs after the item that was REDEFINED --
000500* not after however far into it the redefinition reached. SHORT
000600* covers only 5 of A's 20 bytes and TAIL must still follow A.
000700 DATA DIVISION.
000800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000900 01  REC.
001000     02  A     PIC X(20) VALUE '12345678901234567890'.
001100     02  B     REDEFINES A.
001200         03  B1 PIC X(4).
001300         03  B2 PIC X(16).
001400     02  SHORT REDEFINES A.
001500         03  S1 PIC X(5).
001600     02  NEST  REDEFINES A.
001700         03  N1 PIC X(8).
001800         03  N2 REDEFINES N1.
001900             04  N2A PIC X(3).
002000             04  N2B PIC X(5).
002100         03  N3 PIC X(12).
002200     02  TAIL  PIC X(6)  VALUE 'TAILXX'.
002300 01  AFTER01   PIC X(4)  VALUE 'NEXT'.
002400 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002500     DISPLAY 'B1  ' B1.
002600     DISPLAY 'B2  ' B2.
002700     DISPLAY 'S1  ' S1.
002800     DISPLAY 'N1  ' N1.
002900     DISPLAY 'N2A ' N2A.
003000     DISPLAY 'N2B ' N2B.
003100     DISPLAY 'N3  ' N3.
003200     DISPLAY 'TAIL' TAIL.
003300     DISPLAY 'NEXT' AFTER01.
